          ' *   1. WebSocket Realtime API → gpt-4o-transcribe        (server VAD, noise reduction)\n' +
          ' *   2. WebSocket Realtime API → gpt-4o-mini-transcribe   (server VAD, noise reduction)\n' +
          ' *   3. REST API              → whisper-1                 (client VAD flush)\n' +
          ' *\n' +
          ' * Implements the same EventEmitter interface as all other STT providers:\n' +
          " *   Events:  'transcript' ({ text, isFinal, confidence }), 'error' (Error)\n" +
